<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-6004] SQL: add &quot;inlineSize&quot; to QuerySqlField annotation</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6004</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&quot;inlineSize&quot; is very important optimization allowing to avoid excessive data page reads when using index. However, it can only be set through &lt;tt&gt;QueryEntity&lt;/tt&gt; -&amp;gt; &lt;tt&gt;QueryIndex&lt;/tt&gt; chain, and cannot be set through &lt;tt&gt;&amp;#64;QuerySqlField&lt;/tt&gt; annotation.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Let&apos;s fix that and add &lt;tt&gt;int indexInlineSize&lt;/tt&gt; parameter to that annotation.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13093424">IGNITE-6004</key>
